cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IQ-TREE-GPU, please cite both this tool and IQ-TREE 3."
title: "IQ-TREE-GPU: an exact GPU likelihood backend for IQ-TREE 3"
abstract: >-
  A GPU implementation of the phylogenetic likelihood kernel for IQ-TREE 3 that is algorithmically
  equivalent to the CPU path: identical topology (Robinson-Foulds distance 0) and log-likelihoods
  agreeing to within 1e-4 relative difference across the recorded benchmark campaign.
type: software
version: "0.1.0-dev"
license: GPL-2.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/kosticlab/iqtree3-gpu"   # PLACEHOLDER: replace at standalone release
authors:
  - family-names: Cho
    given-names: Terry
    email: tedblry@gmail.com
    # PLACEHOLDER: add affiliation and ORCID before release
keywords:
  - phylogenetics
  - maximum likelihood
  - GPU
  - CUDA
  - IQ-TREE
references:
  - type: software
    title: "IQ-TREE 3"
    notes: >-
      This project is a patch against IQ-TREE 3 at commit
      6401e06905f65a11ccd6e45f369a1987d657d600 (reported version 3.1.3) and inherits its GPL-2.0
      license. IQ-TREE must be cited alongside this tool.
    repository-code: "https://github.com/iqtree/iqtree3"
# PLACEHOLDER: add `doi:` and `date-released:` when a tagged release + Zenodo DOI exist.
